  "details": "1. Run a Build & Test with 0 Clients to register a build.\n\n2. Use VRC Quick Launcher to launch two clients (using different profiles logged into different accounts) in Offline mode for that build with Watch Worlds/Reload enabled.\n\n3. Clients are connected in the same local instance as expected.\n\n4. Run a new Build & Reload from the SDK.\n\n5. Clients will attempt to reload and now create a new instance per account/client, instead of a single new connected instance.\n\nOffline Build & Test Clients are expected to reload with the same clients they were initially connected to, regardless of profile. This unfortunately means you need to launch two new clients every time you want to reload, making the reload worlds/watch worlds flag unusable with multiple profiles.",
